• Growth Hacking Specialist - AI opportunity analysis

3. Digital Marketing & SEO
• Digital Marketing Manager - Channel orchestration
• SEO/SEM Specialist - AI search optimization
• Paid Media Coordinator - AI bid management
• Marketing Automation Specialist - AI workflows

4. Content & Creative
• Content Marketing Manager - AI content strategy
