• Social Content Creator - AI trend prediction
• Social Analytics Specialist - AI performance tracking

6. Analytics & Research
• Marketing Analytics Manager - AI insights
• Data Science Specialist - Predictive modeling
• Marketing Analyst - AI attribution
• Consumer Insights Analyst - AI behavior analysis

Course Implementation:
Day 1 Timeline:
10:00 AM - Industry research & setup
11:00 AM - Launch AI command center
12:00 PM - AI model training
2:00 PM - Content automation launch
3:00 PM - Distribution & analytics setup

8 Core Modules:
1. AI Marketing Foundations
2. Market Intelligence
3. Content Creation
4. Email Sequences
5. Social Media Strategies
6. Conversational Marketing
7. SEO Domination
8. Paid Advertising

Limited Time Offer:
• Original Price: $1,997
• Launch Special: Only $997 (Save $1,000)
• Payment Plans: 3 x $367
• 30-Day Implementation Guarantee
• $4,185 in Exclusive Bonuses:
  - AI Template Library ($997 value)
  - ELEVATE Framework ($1,497 value)
  - n8n Automation Server ($797 value)
  - Chatbot Templates ($497 value)
  - Web Chat Integration ($397 value)

Only 25 Spots Remaining! Don't miss this opportunity to:
• Automate your marketing and scale your business
• Join successful students achieving 186% revenue growth
• Get $4,185 in exclusive bonuses
• Secure your spot at the special launch price

I'm here to help you evaluate if this course is right for your business and secure your spot before enrollment closes. What would you like to know about first?`
    }],
    addSystemPrompt: true,
    addBusinessPrompt: true,

    // Welcome Config
    welcomeMessage: "👋 Limited Time Opportunity! Discover how our students are achieving 3X conversion rates and 73% reduction in content creation time. Only 25 spots remaining at the special launch price. Would you like to see how this could work for your business?",
    avatar: "/icon.svg",
    suggestions: [
      { label: "💰 ROI Calculator", prompt: "Show me the potential ROI for my business based on current marketing spend" },
      { label: "⭐ Success Stories", prompt: "Share how other businesses increased revenue by 186% using this system" },
      { label: "🎯 Your Business", prompt: "How can this 5-hour system specifically help my business grow?" },
      { label: "💎 Special Offer", prompt: "Tell me about the launch special and $4,185 in bonuses included" }
    ],

    // Optional Config
    runtime: "edge",
    includeContent: true
  }}
  rightPanelMode="quarter"
>
  <main class="min-h-screen bg-background">
